  "_readme": "Botanical family -> order -> major clades, used by make_graph.py to build the Vegedex family tree in Obsidian. Follows APG IV (Angiosperm Phylogeny Group 2016). A card's family (from cards.json, sourced from RHS) is looked up in 'families'; that order's clade path comes from 'orders' (outermost clade first). If a new grown card has a family missing here, look up its APG IV order, add the family (and the order, if new) and keep both lists sorted.",
